{"type":"text","timestamp":1789780831019,"sessionID":"ses_f48c075a1ffebhWMc57JFW1lfM","part":{"id":"prt_0b7402613001ZmrH8OKCnqQUcg","messageID":"msg_0b74016930015b59mW3wkG2xyC","sessionID":"ses_f48c075a1ffebhWMc57JFW1lfM","type":"text","text":"The detail endpoint lacks an organization-membership check, and updates rely on that endpoint’s authorization. List requests already check membership before cache access, but their cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate list entries. I’ll fix those paths and add regression coverage for cache isolation, invalidation, and denied requests.","time":{"start":1789780829715,"end":1789780831009},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_026ef1b5ad2b626d016aade35d9afc87d1ad5312b99781452f","phase":"commentary"}}}}
