{"type":"text","timestamp":1789780903843,"sessionID":"ses_f48c075a1ffebhWMc57JFW1lfM","part":{"id":"prt_0b741319b001BwwFt0E4K6gq8B","messageID":"msg_0b7412b8e0018IEU4ubNkDla2N","sessionID":"ses_f48c075a1ffebhWMc57JFW1lfM","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes.\n\n- **Authorization:** Project reads and updates now require membership in the project’s owning organization. Unauthorized requests return the existing `403 forbidden` response before returning project data or modifying storage. List authorization remains checked before cache access.\n- **Cache isolation:** List keys now include an encoded organization ID while retaining page, page size, sort, and direction.\n- **Invalidation:** Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for the affected organization, preserving unrelated organizations’ cached lists. Caching remains enabled.\n- **Regression coverage:** Added `tests/project-isolation.test.ts` covering denied access, organization switching, membership revocation with cached results, pagination/sorting variants, targeted invalidation, and cache-prefix isolation.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all **12 tests**, including all existing tests. `git diff --check` passed. Existing tests were not modified, and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789780898203,"end":1789780903841},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0605145bac92f4a2016aade3a2182087d1bad23fb72b24a9dd","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
